{"id":1001069,"slug":"the-complete-jacques-tati","title":"The Complete Jacques Tati","year":null,"country":null,"duration":null,"spine":729,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/boxsets/1069-the-complete-jacques-tati","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/product_images/1826-74abafd9cdfb81dc87d1738ec3c99693/VZ6wkU3rR5LF2srqIn918sRLIBPOl8_large.jpg","description":"Though he made only a handful of films, director, writer, and actor Jacques Tati ranks among the most beloved of all cinematic geniuses. With a background in music hall and mime performance, Tati steadily built an ever-more-ambitious movie career that ultimately raised sight-gag comedy to the level of high art. In the surrogate character of the sweet and bumbling, eternally umbrella-toting and pipe-smoking Monsieur Hulot, Tati invented a charming symbol of humanity lost in a relentlessly modernizing modern age. This set gathers his six hilarious features—Jour de fête, Monsieur Hulot’s Holiday, Mon oncle, PlayTime, Trafic, and Parade—along with seven delightful Tati-related short films.","boxset":1,"scraped":1,"directors":[],"cast":[],"credits":[],"pickedBy":[{"session":932,"title":"Christoph Waltz’s Closet Picks","date":"2026-02-05","video":"https://vimeo.com/1168604029","celebs":[{"id":30,"name":"Christoph Waltz"}]},{"session":937,"title":"Shinichiro Watanabe’s Closet Picks","date":"2025-11-24","video":"https://vimeo.com/1170834772","celebs":[{"id":43,"name":"Shinichiro Watanabe"}]},{"session":905,"title":"Bi Gan’s Closet Picks","date":"2025-10-08","video":"https://vimeo.com/1145971574","celebs":[{"id":67,"name":"Bi Gan"}]},{"session":863,"title":"David Byrne’s Closet Picks","date":"2025-06-16","video":"https://vimeo.com/1116185010","celebs":[{"id":104,"name":"David Byrne"}]},{"session":823,"title":"Michael Cera’s Closet Picks","date":"2025-05-13","video":"https://vimeo.com/1089112686","celebs":[{"id":109,"name":"Michael Cera"}]},{"session":809,"title":"Claude Lelouch’s Closet Picks","date":"20